    "body": "Draft for visibility and backup; not for review yet.\n\nExample: run the agent on a program and watch the canvas beside the editor: type aliases as nodes, functions as edges, the avatar hopping to each edit.\n\nThis branch merges refactorings, agent-hardening, probes-iv, user-livelits and (as of today) modular-editors, and adds the Constellation canvas sidebar. Design and status: `plans/agent-canvas.md`, `plans/agent-canvas-docket.md`, `plans/agent-items-convergence.md` (next step: one program spine for the outline, per-item statics and the agent's structural edits).\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n\n---\n### Fixes brought over from the aria-demo branch (2026-09-09)\nTwelve small commits, ~400 lines total. Five are canvas-specific; the other seven duplicate fixes that also landed on agent-hardening / modular-editors (same content, this branch's W2 code shape) so they will merge as no-ops later.\nCanvas-specific:\n- d7ba5475dc / 444b1ac0be Compositional statics: editing a livelit definition re-analyzes its uses; livelit uses are probed for their live view (fixes \"did not produce HTML\" placeholders).\n- a79c226e4c Doc slides keep their indentation on load (explicit-indentation editor).\n- 422fe0450e / 73325cb58c Constellation mode: wells refresh while a definition cell is open; wells act on the master editor and outline the selected sample.\nDuplicated from upstream branches:\n- 3af99f85b1 Spine roots carry the whole-suffix elab (edits to any definition but the first were never re-evaluated) \u2014 also on modular-editors.\n- 7e1c6ac4e0, a59163e0b0, 6b12ab650c, 6e533418e7, d3489d849a, 25c6c57790 \u2014 the Menhir / worker / debounce / Probe All fixes, also on agent-hardening (#2427).\n",
